 starts as a simple mistake quickly becomes a nightmare of liminal spaces, psychological dread, and primal fear.\nYou are trapped in an infinite network of moist yellow hallways, buzzing fluorescent lights, dripping pipes, and maddeningly repetitive architecture. The walls seem to breathe. The lights flicker with a mind of their own. Every echo and distant sound makes your heart race as the Backrooms themselves shift and change around you.\nWander alone through procedurally connected levels that grow more surreal and dangerous the deeper you go. Scavenge for supplies, read cryptic notes, and fight to keep your sanity while uncovering the disturbing truth behind this place. But you are never truly alone.\nGrotesque entities stalk the halls \u2014 some chase at terrifying speed, others hunt by sound, and some appear without warning. One wrong step or loud noise can trigger a heart-pounding chase where hiding and holding your breath become your only hope.\nKey Features:\n\nFull VR immersion designed specifically for virtual reality horror\nDynamic, ever-changing levels filled with liminal atmosphere\nRealistic 3D spatial audio that makes every footstep and growl feel dangerously close\nIntense stealth and pursuit gameplay\nSanity, stamina, and resource management systems\nDeep lore and collectibles that reveal the horrifying story", "short_description": "Primal Rooms is a Backrooms VR game that plunges you into the endless, unsettling maze of yellow-tinted hallways, flickering lights, and primal dread. Wander alone through shifting liminal spaces, survive the entities that hunt you, and uncover the terrifying truth hidden in the depths of the Backrooms.\nImmersive VR horror. No escape. Only survival."}]}, "developer_name": "Dream Verse Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1ztV5Jp4uTGb5W-DBeFZ1BuDhDrF0QDAAaSIJKEwVcvk/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "rm3_mp11", "support_website_url": null